&lt;h4 id=&quot;What-We-Do&quot; data-local-id=&quot;432e0d2e-c512-4354-ade0-4355156251c7&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;903&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun MacChromeBold SCXW61220893 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW61220893 BCX0&quot;&gt;Your role at MOIA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW61220893 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:300}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As (Senior)&amp;nbsp;International Standards Manager, you&amp;nbsp;are responsible for&amp;nbsp;defining&amp;nbsp;and implementing our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;standardization strategy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;ensuring&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;standards&amp;nbsp;compliance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;throughout the product&amp;nbsp;lifecycle.&amp;nbsp;Our product&amp;nbsp;is the autonomous&amp;nbsp;ID.Buzz&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;all the necessary systems in our ecosystem&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;operate&amp;nbsp;it&amp;nbsp;with passengers&amp;nbsp;on public roads.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:300}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Based on&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;EU and US&amp;nbsp;standards&amp;nbsp;for automated driving&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;and our current work on and with&amp;nbsp;standards&amp;nbsp;you&amp;nbsp;create&amp;nbsp;a strategy&amp;nbsp;for engagement with SDOs.&amp;nbsp;As&amp;nbsp;standards play a&amp;nbsp;part&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;our product compliance management system, you will&amp;nbsp;govern the processes to implement&amp;nbsp;our&amp;nbsp;product according to relevant standards.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:300}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Segoe UI&quot; data-listid=&quot;13&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551671&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;0&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Set a standardization strategy: Develop a thoughtful and coordinated company-wide strategy for MOIA’s engagement with SDOs (including ISO, IEEE,&amp;nbsp;ETSI,&amp;nbsp;and SAE).&amp;nbsp;This strategy should define clear goals, levels of engagement, and governance processes for content accountability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Segoe UI&quot; data-listid=&quot;13&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551671&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;0&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Act as an internal/external medium: Serve as the primary liaison between MOIA’s internal practices and external SDOs. Actively work to consolidate internal consensus and assess how MOIA’s practices align with or differ from external ones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Segoe UI&quot; data-listid=&quot;13&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551671&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;0&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Run internal training. Develop and implement internal training programs that align engineering, product, and cross-functional teams with external standardization landscapes, compliance goals, and MOIA’s internal policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Segoe UI&quot; data-listid=&quot;13&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551671&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;0&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Shape the industry by strategically prioritizing MOIA’s participation in working groups to contribute to shaping consensus and advancing autonomous mobility while retaining the necessary optionality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Segoe UI&quot; data-listid=&quot;13&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551671&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;0&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Cross-functional coordination: Collaborate closely with the engineering and safety teams, as well as the legal and regulatory groups, to establish appropriate platforms for critiquing perspectives and consolidating a consistent position on topics of interest.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
