&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Campaign Executive, you will play an important role in the success of our influencer marketing campaigns. You will assist in the end-to-end execution of campaigns, from concept through to delivery, ensuring that each project meets its objectives and delivers excellent results for our clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the day-to-day operations of influencer marketing campaigns, ensuring seamless execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop compelling proposals for prospective clients, leveraging expertise in influencers and creative strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Account Managers in client communications and play a key role in client presentations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee campaign success by managing KPIs, budgets across multiple campaigns, and delivering exceptional results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide in-depth campaign reports and work with Account Managers to maintain strong client relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting the delivery of influencer marketing campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 2 years&#39; relevant experience in planning and executing influencer campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable experience in delegating and prioritising a constantly changing workload.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competent writing and communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work effectively and calmly under pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of influencer marketing and social metrics (impressions, reach, engagements).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reside within London or within a commutable distance to our London office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
