&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Ogilvy &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ogilvy, part of WPP, has been creating impact for brands through iconic, culture-changing, value-driving ideas since the company was founded by David Ogilvy 75 years ago. It builds on that rich legacy through Borderless Creativity – innovating at the intersections of its advertising, public relations, relationship design, consulting, and health capabilities with experts collaborating seamlessly across over 120 offices in nearly 90 countries. Ogilvy currently &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ogilvy.com/ideas/ogilvy-tops-warc-effective-100-creative-100-rankings-third-straight-year&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;ranks&lt;/a&gt; as the #1 global agency network for creative excellence and effectiveness by WARC, signifying its ability to deliver creative solutions that drive unreasonable impact for clients and communities. Ogilvy is a WPP company (NYSE: WPP). For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.ogilvy.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Ogilvy.com&lt;/a&gt;, and follow us on &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__https:/www.linkedin.com/company/ogilvy/__;!!FMox2LFwyA!4Z5sYRsQCsdV4dIxzo5cqM97oclKST23C6w0s209mLcXxT5_tuCL0fM31Se_7mxpVA$&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__https:/twitter.com/ogilvy__;!!FMox2LFwyA!4Z5sYRsQCsdV4dIxzo5cqM97oclKST23C6w0s209mLcXxT5_tuCL0fM31SccaJbNMQ$&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__https:/www.instagram.com/ogilvy/__;!!FMox2LFwyA!4Z5sYRsQCsdV4dIxzo5cqM97oclKST23C6w0s209mLcXxT5_tuCL0fM31SfRZhifmA$&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, and&lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__https:/www.facebook.com/ogilvy/__;!!FMox2LFwyA!4Z5sYRsQCsdV4dIxzo5cqM97oclKST23C6w0s209mLcXxT5_tuCL0fM31ScfS6rLGg$&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; Facebook.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite&amp;nbsp;cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel&amp;nbsp;in a single company –&amp;nbsp;powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open,&amp;nbsp;to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://wpp.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;7f087527-f491-4cb6-a79d-3b4a67d1ec89&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Account Director&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;Consumer PR&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Department: &lt;/strong&gt;Consumer PR &amp;amp; Influence&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;London&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contract Type: &lt;/strong&gt;Fixed-Term 12-Months&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Time/Part time:&lt;/strong&gt; Full Time&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting into: &lt;/strong&gt;Business Director / Client Partner&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a talented individual to join our team as an Account Director on a large technology account. You’ll spearhead high-impact PR campaigns and run a fast-paced press office that spans both consumer and corporate remits.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are a natural problem solver who thrives on challenge and builds instinctive, collaborative relationships across different agency Capabilities and Crafts. Combining a deep understanding of strategy with flawless execution, you will ensure the team constantly delivers creative, quality work that moves the needle for our client.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years’ of PR experience, ideally with a “corpsumer” background&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine interest in consumer tech and the evolving world of AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of the UK media landscape and established journalist relationships&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of managing fast-paced press offices and navigating complex, multi-stakeholder projects spanning consumer, corporate and policy remits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Established as a trusted advisor to mid-level clients, with a strong grasp of their business context, challenges and goals&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A natural problem-solver who looks at briefs from unexpected angles and pushes for innovative ways to sell in and execute work&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Takes ownership of large projects and is accountable for both work and process&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An empowering mentor who guides junior team members, manages up effectively, and fosters a collaborative team culture&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercially astute, with experience managing budgets, scoping work, and resource planning to hit targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain strong relationships with clients, becoming a trusted partner and advisor&lt;/li&gt;
